=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync container -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net is a container:$
# its clock is its host's, no time service is looked for, and$
# hardn sets nothing.$
$
# Time Sync ####################################################$
$
  [-] Time Sync            Not Applicable in a container$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              None$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  In a container: the host keeps the time.$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          The host keeps the time$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

